# RiskSignal — Docker build context exclusions.
# Keep the context small and free of secrets; source under cmd/, internal/,
# api/, db/ and web/ stays available for multi-stage builds (db/ holds the
# migrations that are embedded into the binaries later, ADR-010).

.git
bin/
dist/
build/
docs/
testdata/
coverage.out
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
